    "Nothing in the records below was edited by hand: each is what a writer returned (a frame, a calibration, a sidecar) or sent.",
    "This file is not regenerated. A build that writes more than these records has more records to keep, not different ones:",
    "its writers' output goes in a file beside this one, and both stay."
